@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
title Civ13 simple-animal behavior and combat stances
[*] --> LifeDispatch
LifeDispatch --> Suppressed : state / client / anchor / empty server / movement gates
LifeDispatch --> Feeding : hunger takes priority
LifeDispatch --> Behaviour : handle_ai throttle permits
Behaviour --> Wandering : wander / scared
Behaviour --> Idle : combat handler with IDLE stance
Behaviour --> Alert : combat handler with ALERT stance
Idle --> Attack : FindTarget selects valid target
Alert --> Idle : target missing long enough
Alert --> Attack : stance threshold / hostile mode
Attack --> Tired : hunt fatigue threshold
Tired --> Attack : rested with target
Tired --> Idle : rested without target
Attack --> Idle : LoseTarget / LostTarget
Attack --> Attack : pursuit / cover / attack / surroundings
Feeding --> LifeDispatch : next Life
Wandering --> LifeDispatch : next Life
Suppressed --> LifeDispatch : next Life
note right of Attack
Simplified stance abstraction.
FindTarget can enter ATTACK directly.
ALERT is not a mandatory intermediate.
Subtype methods extend attack/target behavior.
Native walking can run between Life calls.
end note
